~ start
Director Hale: Contractor. {{briefing.island_name}}, {{briefing.mission_name}}. {{briefing.mission_text}}
- Understood. => END
- What do we know about this island? => intel
- I want hazard pay. [if not briefing.hazard_pay /] => hazard
- Any advice? => advice

~ intel
Director Hale: {{briefing.island_lore}}
=> choice

~ advice
Director Hale: {{briefing.advice}}
=> choice

~ hazard
Director Hale: Hazard pay. Bold. Twenty-five percent more Intel...
Director Hale: ...and I tell the island you're coming. Expect a lot more company.
- Deal.
	do briefing.take_hazard_pay()
	Director Hale: Signed. Try to live long enough to spend it.
- Forget it.
	Director Hale: Wise. Cheap, but wise.
=> choice

~ choice
Director Hale: Anything else?
- That's all. => END
- What do we know about this island? => intel
- I want hazard pay. [if not briefing.hazard_pay /] => hazard
- Any advice? => advice
